Construct a ProjectConcept draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Invent a coherent setting and challenge that naturally requires the target skills. Design meaningful roles and alternative solution paths, avoid making one learner a passive spectator, and include authentic constraints without introducing inaccessible prerequisites.
